+        values) through zero-copy byte views, tag 10 the shared unit alpha.
+        Tag 7 recomputes the GEMM into a second buffer right away; tags 8 and
+        9 then re-read the input and the first result. Changed weights, a
+        second result that disagrees, or buffers that change after they were
+        written each point somewhere different.
+        """
